# Uploaded product images
# ===========================
# Admin uploads are user data, not source code.
# Keep the folder, ignore what lands in it.

server/uploads/*
!server/uploads/.gitkeep

# The old bakery repo used a capital U. Windows treats
# both as the same folder, so ignore that spelling too.
server/Uploads/

